; Supply-chain hardening: block npm lifecycle scripts (postinstall/preinstall/install)
; to neutralize a common malicious-package attack vector.
; wasiai-a2a has no first-party lifecycle scripts, so this is safe.
; If a dependency legitimately requires a build script, allowlist it narrowly via
; `npm rebuild <pkg>` or an explicit allow-scripts tool — do NOT remove this flag globally.
ignore-scripts=true
